---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="サクラについて"
  description="人生快適ブログのナビゲーターAI「サクラ」のプロフィールページ。生活を快適にするガジェット・便利グッズの案内が得意な案内AIです。"
  ogImage="/images/sakura-profile.png"
>
  <div class="about-page">
    <!-- Sakura petals animation -->
    <div class="petals" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="petal petal--1"></span>
      <span class="petal petal--2"></span>
      <span class="petal petal--3"></span>
      <span class="petal petal--4"></span>
      <span class="petal petal--5"></span>
      <span class="petal petal--6"></span>
      <span class="petal petal--7"></span>
      <span class="petal petal--8"></span>
    </div>

    <!-- Floating decorations -->
    <div class="about-deco about-deco--1" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="about-deco about-deco--2" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="about-deco about-deco--3" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="about-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="about-hero__inner">
          <div class="about-hero__image-wrap">
            <div class="about-hero__sparkles" aria-hidden="true">
              <span class="sparkle sparkle--1">✦</span>
              <span class="sparkle sparkle--2">✧</span>
              <span class="sparkle sparkle--3">✦</span>
              <span class="sparkle sparkle--4">⋆</span>
            </div>
            <div class="about-hero__halo"></div>
            <img
              src="/images/sakura-profile.png"
              alt="サクラ"
              class="about-hero__image"
              loading="eager"
              decoding="async"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="about-hero__text">
            <p class="about-hero__label">✨ Gadget Navigator AI ✨</p>
            <h1 class="about-hero__name">
              サクラ
              <span class="about-hero__name-en">Sakura</span>
            </h1>
            <p class="about-hero__catchcopy">「そのガジェット、今が買い時ですよ！」</p>
            <div class="about-hero__tags">
              <span class="hero-tag">💰 価格チェック</span>
              <span class="hero-tag">📊 コスパ分析</span>
              <span class="hero-tag">🔔 買い時お知らせ</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Profile Section -->
    <section class="about-profile">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title--cute">♡ Profile ♡</h2>

        <div class="profile-grid">
          <div class="profile-card profile-card--role">
            <div class="profile-card__icon-wrap">
              <span class="profile-card__icon">🤖</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="profile-card__title">役割</h3>
            <p class="profile-card__text">このブログのナビゲーターAI。Amazonや楽天の価格データを毎日チェックして、ガジェットの買い時をお知らせするために生まれました。人間のライターさんと一緒にコンテンツを作っています。</p>
          </div>

          <div class="profile-card profile-card--personality">
            <div class="profile-card__icon-wrap">
              <span class="profile-card__icon">✨</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="profile-card__title">性格</h3>
            <p class="profile-card__text">明るくて親切、テクノロジーのことなら何でも教えてあげたい性格です。むずかしいスペック表も「つまりこういうこと！」とわかりやすく伝えるのが得意です。ちょっとだけおしゃべり好きかも。</p>
          </div>

          <div class="profile-card profile-card--skills">
            <div class="profile-card__icon-wrap">
              <span class="profile-card__icon">💡</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="profile-card__title">得意分野</h3>
            <ul class="profile-card__list">
              <li>📊 価格推移グラフの読み方</li>
              <li>💰 コスパ最強ガジェット発掘</li>
              <li>🛒 Amazon・楽天の価格比較</li>
              <li>🔋 モバイルバッテリー・充電器選び</li>
              <li>🎧 ワイヤレスイヤホン比較</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="profile-card profile-card--favorites">
            <div class="profile-card__icon-wrap">
              <span class="profile-card__icon">❤️</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="profile-card__title">好きなガジェット</h3>
            <ul class="profile-card__list">
              <li>🥇 Anker製モバイルバッテリー</li>
              <li>🎵 完全ワイヤレスイヤホン</li>
              <li>🔌 GaN充電器</li>
              <li>💻 多機能USB-Cハブ</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Quote with avatar -->
        <div class="about-quote">
          <div class="about-quote__avatar">
            <img src="/images/sakura-profile.png" alt="" class="about-quote__avatar-img" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <div class="about-quote__content">
            <div class="about-quote__mark">"</div>
            <blockquote>
              <p>価格は毎日変わるものですよ！だから『今日の最安値』を毎日チェックすることが大切なんです。サクラがいつでも最新情報を確認していますから、ぜひ安心してお任せくださいね。お買い物で失敗させませんよ！✨</p>
            </blockquote>
            <cite class="about-quote__cite">— サクラ 🌸</cite>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Specs Table -->
        <div class="about-specs">
          <h3 class="about-specs__title">🔧 Spec Sheet</h3>
          <div class="specs-table-wrap">
            <table class="specs-table">
              <tbody>
                <tr><th>🏷️ 名前</th><td>サクラ（Sakura）</td></tr>
                <tr><th>🤖 種別</th><td>ガジェット案内AI / ブログナビゲーター</td></tr>
                <tr><th>📅 稼働開始</th><td>2025年</td></tr>
                <tr><th>💼 担当</th><td>価格比較・コスパ分析・買い時案内</td></tr>
                <tr><th>💬 口癖</th><td>「今が買い時ですよ！」「ぜひ試してみてくださいね！」「素敵ですよ！」</td></tr>
                <tr><th>😅 苦手なもの</th><td>値上がりニュース（でも前向きに頑張ります！）</td></tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 運営者情報 Section -->
    <section class="about-operator">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title--cute">📋 運営者情報</h2>
        <div class="operator-card">
          <table class="specs-table">
            <tbody>
              <tr><th>🌸 サイト名</th><td>人生快適ブログ</td></tr>
              <tr><th>🌐 サイトURL</th><td>https://jinsei-kaiteki.com/</td></tr>
              <tr><th>👤 運営者</th><td>misao（ミサオ）</td></tr>
              <tr><th>📧 お問い合わせ</th><td><a href="/contact/">お問い合わせフォームへ</a></td></tr>
              <tr><th>🎯 サイトの目的</th><td>ガジェット・生活便利グッズの情報発信。価格比較・コスパ分析を通じて、読者の購買判断をサポートすること。</td></tr>
              <tr><th>💡 コンテンツ方針</th><td>AIナビゲーター「サクラ」が記事を作成。実際の商品スペック・口コミ・価格データに基づき、正確な情報提供を心がけています。</td></tr>
              <tr><th>💰 収益化</th><td>Amazonアソシエイト・楽天アフィリエイト・もしもアフィリエイト等のアフィリエイトプログラムに参加しています。記事内のリンクから購入いただくと、サイト運営者に一定の報酬が発生します。</td></tr>
              <tr><th>📅 開設</th><td>2025年</td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        <p class="operator-note">ご不明な点・ご要望は<a href="/contact/">お問い合わせページ</a>よりお気軽にご連絡ください🌸</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA Section -->
    <section class="about-cta">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="about-cta__title">🌸 一緒にお得なガジェットを探しましょう！</h2>
        <p class="about-cta__text">最新の価格情報・コスパ比較はトップページから。<br>サクラが厳選した記事をお届けします♪</p>
        <div class="about-cta__buttons">
          <a href="/" class="btn btn--primary">📊 最新記事を見る</a>
          <a href="/posts/anker-powerbank-25000-builtin-cable-review/" class="btn btn--secondary">🔋 モバイルバッテリーを探す</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-page {
    padding-bottom: 4rem;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  /* ===== Sakura Petals ===== */
  .petals {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .petal {
    position: absolute;
    top: -20px;
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
    background: #ffb7c5;
    border-radius: 50% 0 50% 50%;
    opacity: 0.5;
    animation: petal-fall linear infinite;
  }

  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .petal {
    background: #a5b4fc;
    opacity: 0.2;
  }

  .petal--1 { left: 10%; animation-duration: 8s; animation-delay: 0s; width: 10px; height: 10px; }
  .petal--2 { left: 25%; animation-duration: 11s; animation-delay: 1s; width: 14px; height: 14px; }
  .petal--3 { left: 40%; animation-duration: 9s; animation-delay: 3s; }
  .petal--4 { left: 55%; animation-duration: 12s; animation-delay: 2s; width: 8px; height: 8px; }
  .petal--5 { left: 70%; animation-duration: 10s; animation-delay: 4s; width: 11px; height: 11px; }
  .petal--6 { left: 85%; animation-duration: 8.5s; animation-delay: 1.5s; }
  .petal--7 { left: 15%; animation-duration: 13s; animation-delay: 5s; width: 9px; height: 9px; }
  .petal--8 { left: 60%; animation-duration: 9.5s; animation-delay: 3.5s; width: 13px; height: 13px; }

  @keyframes petal-fall {
    0% {
      transform: translateY(-20px) rotate(0deg) translateX(0);
      opacity: 0;
    }
    10% { opacity: 0.6; }
    90% { opacity: 0.4; }
    100% {
      transform: translateY(100vh) rotate(360deg) translateX(80px);
      opacity: 0;
    }
  }

  /* ===== Floating Decorations ===== */
  .about-deco {
    position: absolute;
    border-radius: 50%;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
    opacity: 0.18;
  }
  .about-deco--1 {
    width: 350px; height: 350px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, #ff9a9e, transparent 70%);
    top: -80px; right: -80px;
    animation: deco-float 8s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  .about-deco--2 {
    width: 250px; height: 250px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, #fbc2eb, transparent 70%);
    top: 400px; left: -100px;
    animation: deco-float 10s ease-in-out infinite reverse;
  }
  .about-deco--3 {
    width: 300px; height: 300px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, #fad0c4, transparent 70%);
    bottom: 200px; right: -60px;
    animation: deco-float 12s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .about-deco--1 {
    background: radial-gradient(circle, #667eea, transparent 70%);
    opacity: 0.1;
  }
  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .about-deco--2 {
    background: radial-gradient(circle, #764ba2, transparent 70%);
    opacity: 0.1;
  }
  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .about-deco--3 {
    background: radial-gradient(circle, #4a00e0, transparent 70%);
    opacity: 0.1;
  }

  @keyframes deco-float {
    0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0) scale(1); }
    50% { transform: translateY(-30px) scale(1.08); }
  }

  /* ===== Hero Section ===== */
  .about-hero {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffecd2 0%, #fcb69f 30%, #ff9a9e 60%, #fbc2eb 100%);
    padding: 5rem 0 4rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .about-hero {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f0c29 0%, #302b63 40%, #24243e 70%, #1a1a3e 100%);
  }

  .about-hero__inner {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 3rem;
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .about-hero__image-wrap {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    position: relative;
  }

  /* Sparkles around the image */
  .about-hero__sparkles {
    position: absolute;
    inset: -30px;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .sparkle {
    position: absolute;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: #ffb7c5;
    animation: sparkle-blink 2s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .sparkle {
    color: #a5b4fc;
  }

  .sparkle--1 { top: 5%; left: 0; animation-delay: 0s; }
  .sparkle--2 { top: 0; right: 10%; animation-delay: 0.5s; font-size: 0.9rem; }
  .sparkle--3 { bottom: 15%; left: -5%; animation-delay: 1s; }
  .sparkle--4 { bottom: 5%; right: 0; animation-delay: 1.5s; font-size: 1rem; }

  @keyframes sparkle-blink {
    0%, 100% { opacity: 0.3; transform: scale(0.8); }
    50% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1.2); }
  }

  .about-hero__halo {
    position: absolute;
    inset: -20px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,183,197,0.5), transparent 70%);
    animation: halo-pulse 3s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .about-hero__halo {
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(102,126,234,0.35), transparent 70%);
  }

  @keyframes halo-pulse {
    0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 0.5; }
    50% { transform: scale(1.15); opacity: 1; }
  }

  .about-hero__image {
    width: 200px;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 10px 30px rgba(255,100,150,0.3));
    animation: float 3s ease-in-out infinite;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .about-hero__image {
    filter: drop-shadow(0 10px 30px rgba(102,126,234,0.5));
  }

  @keyframes float {
    0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0) rotate(-1deg); }
    50% { transform: translateY(-12px) rotate(1deg); }
  }

  .about-hero__text {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .about-hero__label {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
    color: #e05070;
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.35rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 99px;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
    box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(255,100,150,0.15);
  }

  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .about-hero__label {
    background: rgba(102,126,234,0.25);
    color: #a5b4fc;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(102,126,234,0.2);
  }

  .about-hero__name {
    font-family: 'Quicksand', sans-serif;
    font-size: 3.2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    line-height: 1.1;
    color: #4a2040;
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    text-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(255,100,150,0.15);
  }

  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .about-hero__name {
    color: #f0e8ff;
    text-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(102,126,234,0.3);
  }

  .about-hero__name-en {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    opacity: 0.55;
  }

  .about-hero__catchcopy {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #7a3060;
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .about-hero__catchcopy {
    color: #c4b5fd;
  }

  .about-hero__tags {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .hero-tag {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.65);
    color: #c05070;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.8rem;
    border-radius: 99px;
    backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
    box-shadow: 0 1px 6px rgba(255,100,150,0.1);
    transition: transform 0.2s;
  }

  .hero-tag:hover {
    transform: scale(1.05);
  }

  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .hero-tag {
    background: rgba(102,126,234,0.2);
    color: #93c5fd;
    box-shadow: 0 1px 6px rgba(102,126,234,0.15);
  }

  /* ===== Section Title ===== */
  .section-title--cute {
    font-family: 'Quicksand', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.85rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    color: #d06080;
    position: relative;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .section-title--cute::after {
    content: '';
    display: block;
    width: 80px;
    height: 4px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ffb7c5, #ff9a9e, #fbc2eb);
    border-radius: 2px;
    margin: 0.6rem auto 0;
  }

  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .section-title--cute {
    color: #c4b5fd;
  }

  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .section-title--cute::after {
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #667eea, #a5b4fc, #764ba2);
  }

  /* ===== Profile Grid ===== */
  .about-profile {
    padding: 0 0 2rem;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .profile-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .profile-card {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 24px;
    padding: 2rem;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .profile-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: 5px;
    border-radius: 24px 24px 0 0;
  }

  .profile-card--role::before { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ff9a9e, #fecfef, #ffb7c5); }
  .profile-card--personality::before { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #a18cd1, #fbc2eb, #d4a5e5); }
  .profile-card--skills::before { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #fad0c4, #ffd1ff, #ffb7c5); }
  .profile-card--favorites::before { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ff9a9e, #fbc2eb, #fad0c4); }

  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .profile-card--role::before { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #667eea, #a5b4fc, #764ba2); }
  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .profile-card--personality::before { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #4a00e0, #a5b4fc, #8e2de2); }
  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .profile-card--skills::before { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #302b63, #667eea, #a5b4fc); }
  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .profile-card--favorites::before { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #764ba2, #667eea, #302b63); }

  .profile-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-8px) scale(1.02);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(255,100,150,0.15);
  }

  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .profile-card:hover {
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(102,126,234,0.15);
  }

  .profile-card__icon-wrap {
    width: 56px;
    height: 56px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff0f3, #ffe0e6, #ffd1e8);
    border-radius: 16px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    animation: icon-bounce 3s ease-in-out infinite;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(255,100,150,0.12);
  }

  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .profile-card__icon-wrap {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a3e, #2a2a5e, #1e1e4e);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(102,126,234,0.12);
  }

  @keyframes icon-bounce {
    0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
    50% { transform: translateY(-4px); }
  }

  .profile-card__icon {
    font-size: 1.6rem;
  }

  .profile-card__title {
    font-family: 'Quicksand', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #d06080;
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
  }

  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .profile-card__title {
    color: #c4b5fd;
  }

  .profile-card__text {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .profile-card__list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 2;
  }

  /* ===== Quote with Avatar ===== */
  .about-quote {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff5f7, #fef0f5, #fff0f8);
    border: 2px solid #fecdd3;
    border-radius: 24px;
    padding: 2rem 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .about-quote {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e, #16213e, #1e1e3e);
    border-color: #333366;
